Cluster Setup Notes

Deployment notes for the 2-node Wazuh manager + indexer cluster (wazuh-master / wazuh-worker).

1. Base VM provisioning
Deployed the cluster VMs in VMware on a 16GB RAM Windows 10 host
OS: Ubuntu Server on manager/indexer nodes
Static internal IPs assigned within an isolated lab network
Hostnames set and /etc/hosts updated on all nodes to resolve each other by name

2. Indexer cluster:
bash
# On indexer node(s)
# Install Wazuh indexer package
# Configure opensearch.yml with:
