#   - node.name
#   - network.host
#   - discovery.seed_hosts (other indexer nodes)
#   - cluster.initial_master_nodes

# Generate and distribute TLS certificates for node-to-node and REST API encryption
3. Manager cluster (master + worker)

On the master node, /var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf cluster block:

xml
<cluster>
  <name>wazuh-lab-cluster</name>
  <node_name>master-node</node_name>
  <node_type>master</node_type>
  <key>REPLACE_WITH_GENERATED_CLUSTER_KEY</key>
  <port>1516</port>
  <bind_addr>0.0.0.0</bind_addr>
  <nodes>
    <node>MASTER_NODE_IP</node>
  </nodes>
  <hidden>no</hidden>
  <disabled>no</disabled>
</cluster>

On the worker node, same block but node_type = worker, same cluster key, and <nodes> pointing to the master's IP.
